WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.377
Geodesics that never refocus again.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.835
Nonpositive curvature stops geodesics refocusing. Is the converse true for closed manifolds?

3
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.961
Leeb's graph manifold gets a careful metric

4
00:00:11.961 --> 00:00:14.156
whose geodesics never refocus at all.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.541
Claimed: no, the converse fails in dimension three.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.946
Checked in Lean.
